      "sourceTextSha256": "f1755d50ffbd48afcba4faa6de526bf4bdf6d9df19952090c9b8b3cf138e88fd",
      "text": "Break up the five-hour journey from Monteverde to Manuel Antonio with a two-hour boat tour on the Tárcoles River and into the Guacalillo mangrove estuary, with a bilingual guide: look out for American crocodiles, some over 5 metres long, scarlet macaws from the nearby Carara Biological Reserve and, a favourite with children, basilisk lizards, the “Jesus Christ lizards” that run on water. Overnight at Tabulia Tree. (B, L)",
